        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the transit duration for consignments from Sonipat to Faridabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard highway transit between Sonipat and Faridabad takes approximately 2 to 3 Working Days via dedicated GPS-monitored container trucks with dual-driver rotations ensuring continuous safe movement.</p>
